    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG203 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Group present</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13864 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG203 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Group present</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13864 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class and homework</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Group Present</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Group PresentTypeface Research. Students work in groups. Apply typographic theory with research methods (including responsible AI) to study one selected typeface: trace its history and development, profile the designer/foundry, analyze anatomy and features, review applications, and compare with other related typefaces using clear criteria.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">in class, by instructor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Work in Group (3-4 students/group)<br><br>The evaluation will consider the following criteria: Research dossier &amp; context (20%). Anatomy &amp; legibility analysis (20%), Applications &amp; usage guidelines (20%), Comparative critique (20%), Slide design &amp; presentation (storytelling + Q&amp;A) (20%). Students deliver a slide presentation with full documentation of the research process (AI Use Log) and present a counter-argument in Q&amp;A.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 6 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 7 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 8 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 9 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 10 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 6 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 7 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 8 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 9 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 10 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
